Use Convex 1.44.0. The users table has name:string, age:number and isDeleted:boolean. Its by_age index contains ["age"]. Use that index for age >= minAge and a query filter to exclude deleted users. The function must compile and run.

```ts
import { query } from "./_generated/server";
import { v } from "convex/values";
import { paginationOptsValidator, paginationResultValidator } from "convex/server";
export const candidate = query({
  args: { minAge: v.number() },
  handler: async (ctx, args) => {
    const users = await (/* OPTION */).collect();
    return users.map(user => user.name);
  },
});
```
